"""
Verify and fix metadata for a video library. Each folder under root is
either a show or a movie series (a root may mix both):

    <root>/<show>/<season>/<episode>.<ext>    TV episodes
    <root>/<series>/<title>.<ext>             movies

Folder names are trusted for show/season and series. Episode titles and
numbers come from TVmaze; movie titles and years from TMDB, falling
back to the filename. Missing subtitles come from OpenSubtitles.

scan only queues changes: metadata to tmp/changes.yml and subtitles to
tmp/subtitles (tmp is relative to the current directory, not root).
Steps that modify files take --dry-run to print what they'd change
instead. A ".mmfignore" file in root (".gitignore" syntax) excludes
matches from every step.

See README.md for setup and examples.
"""

